残疾老兵顾卫明闪婚了，却不知丈夫身份大有来头。婚后，她在医院遭刁难，凭医术逆袭，也与顾卫明渐生情愫，先婚后爱。期间历经白月光搅局、继妹陷害等波折，顾卫明身份暴露，两人误会重重。最终，苏闻音治好顾卫明的腿，二人解开误会，携手幸福生活。","series_id":"7498235937550257214","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"202611062331028A9D71C332E914A39FE9\",\"rank\":\"6\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7498235937550257214\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.061023466289043427,\\\"like\\\":0.048136770725250244,\\\"finish\\\":0.0021827169694006443,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7316156029701233,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":0.9228688478469849,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.10215643793344498,\\\"collect\\\":0.035678550601005554}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7498235937550257214","play_cnt":56105,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"冰甜剧场","sub_title":"爱情·年代爱情","score":"8.0","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":70,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5000,\"name\":\"爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5000&categoryName=爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5131,\"name\":\"年代爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5131&categoryName=年代爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5097,\"name\":\"闪婚\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5097&categoryName=闪婚&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5095,\"name\":\"先婚后爱\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5095&categoryName=先婚后爱&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5254,\"name\":\"揭露阴谋\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5254&categoryName=揭露阴谋&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5208,\"name\":\"医生\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5208&categoryName=医生&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"}]","color_dominate":"#704030","horiz_cover":"","sub_title_list":[{"content":"爱情"